,"role":"collection","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-9kkog":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-9kkog","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityDropPoint"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9UnitPointV","text":"UnitPoint","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"description","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnabled","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitydroppoint(_:description:isenabled:)-9kkog"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview"}}}